      "type": "text",
      "layout": "chapter",
      "chapter": "PRODUCT DESIGN",
      "title": "A glass system for the journey ahead.",
      "text": "Flightio Aurora carries the campaign’s color into a focused booking experience. The live study below introduces its glass surfaces, travel-mode controls, route fields, reassurance cues and primary action as one coherent component system."
    },
    {
      "id": "flightio-glass-system",
      "type": "html",
      "title": "Flightio Aurora animated glass design system",
      "autoHeight": true,
      "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0}body{font-family:Inter,Manrope,Arial,sans-serif;background:#101529;color:#fff}.stage{position:relative;min-height:840px;padding:48px clamp(22px,5vw,72px) 68px;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;background:radial-gradient(circle at 82% 10%,#683ca34d,transparent 31%),radial-gradient(circle at 12% 100%,#186eff43,transparent 38%),#101529}.stage:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-15%;z-index:-1;background:conic-gradient(from 210deg at 60% 58%,transparent 0 34%,#448bff24 48%,#d34bff29 60%,#ff876022 73%,transparent 86%);animation:ambient 18s linear infinite}.top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding-bottom:26px;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff2b}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;font-size:25px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.04em}.mark{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(#ff895f,#fa3564,#bb3df2,#396dff,#ffda72,#ff895f);position:relative;animation:orbit 12s linear infinite}.mark:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#17182c}.top small,.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d3c7e5}.intro{max-width:850px;margin:65px 0 44px}.eyebrow{color:#bea8ff}.intro h1{font-size:clamp(44px,5.6vw,76px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.055em;font-weight:550;margin:17px 0}.intro p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#c7c9d8;max-width:60ch}.specimen{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.4fr) minmax(250px,.6fr);gap:18px;max-width:1160px}.glass{border:1px solid #ffffff47;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffffff2c,#ffffff0b 55%,#ffffff1d);backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(150%);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(150%);box-shadow:0 18px 55px #05081766,inset 0 1px #ffffff65;border-radius:24px}.booking{padding:24px;animation:rise .8s both}.modes{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:25px}.mode{border:1px solid #ffffff35;background:#ffffff12;color:#e6e5f0;padding:10px 17px;border-radius:999px;font:600 13px inherit;cursor:pointer;transition:.25s}.mode:hover{background:#ffffff31}.mode.active{background:#fff;color:#26233d;border-color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 20px #ffffff33}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.field{padding:16px 18px;border-radius:16px;background:#070c2399;border:1px solid #ffffff1d}.field label{display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#abb4d4;margin-bottom:8px}.field strong{display:block;font-size:19px;font-weight:600}.bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-top:20px}.bottom span{font-size:12px;color:#c0c8e1}.cta{background:linear-gradient(110deg,#ff765e,#ed3c79 38%,#9743e7 70%,#3477f7);color:white;border:0;border-radius:13px;min-height:48px;padding:0 25px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s}.cta:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 28px #873fe261}.side{display:grid;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.ticket,.token{padding:21px 23px;animation:rise .8s .14s both}.card-kicker{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#b9b2da;text-transform:uppercase}.ticket-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:22px}.ticket-row strong{font-size:23px;font-weight:550}.ticket-row i{display:block;width:47px;height:47px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #7ecaff;box-shadow:0 0 18px #8758ff,inset 0 0 12px #8758ff;animation:pulse 3s ease-in-out infinite}.ticket p{font-size:12px;color:#c0c8e1;margin-bottom:0}.swatches{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:23px 0}.swatches i{width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:50%;display:block;border:1px solid #ffffff55}.token p{font-size:12px;color:#c0c8e1;line-height:1.5;margin:0}.foot{max-width:1160px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-top:28px;color:#aeb7d1;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}.status{min-height:18px;color:#d6f4ff}\n@keyframes ambient{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@keyframes orbit{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@keyframes pulse{50%{box-shadow:0 0 34px #ad61ff,inset 0 0 18px #56b9ff;transform:scale(1.05)}}@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(23px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}\n@media(max-width:760px){.stage{min-height:0;padding:28px 18px 42px}.top{align-items:flex-start}.top small{max-width:12ch;text-align:right;line-height:1.5}.intro{margin:48px 0 30px}.intro h1{font-size:46px}.specimen{grid-template-columns:1fr}.side{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:auto}.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.foot{display:block}.foot span{display:block;margin-bottom:8px}}\n@media(max-width:500px){.side{grid-template-columns:1fr}.booking{padding:18px}.bottom{align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column}.cta{width:100%}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.stage:before,.mark,.ticket-row i,.booking,.ticket,.token{animation:none}.cta,.mode{transition:none}}\n</style></head><body><main class=\"stage\"><header class=\"top\"><div class=\"brand\"><i class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Flightio <span style=\"font-weight:400;opacity:.62\">Aurora</span></div><small>GLASS SYSTEM / 2022</small></header><section class=\"intro\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Digital design system</span><h1>One clear path through every journey.</h1><p>Translucent layers, a focused booking card and one recognizable spectrum bring Flightio’s campaign language into the product experience.</p></section><section class=\"specimen\" aria-label=\"Flightio glass design system demonstration\"><div class=\"booking glass\"><div class=\"modes\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Travel mode\"><button class=\"mode active\" aria-selected=\"true\">Flights</button><button class=\"mode\" aria-selected=\"false\">Trains</button><button class=\"mode\" aria-selected=\"false\">Buses</button></div><div class=\"fields\"><div class=\"field\"><label>From</label><strong>Tehran</strong></div><div class=\"field\"><label>To</label><strong>Shiraz</strong></div><div class=\"field\"><label>Departure</label><strong>18 October</strong></div><div class=\"field\"><label>Travelers</label><strong>1 adult</strong></div></div><div class=\"bottom\"><span>Transparent fares · Secure checkout</span><button class=\"cta\">Search trips ↗</button></div></div><div class=\"side\"><div class=\"ticket glass\"><span class=\"card-kicker\">Journey preview</span><div class=\"ticket-row\"><strong>THR → SYZ</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></div><p>One focused action, with details close at hand.</p></div><div class=\"token glass\"><span class=\"card-kicker\">Visual language</span><div class=\"swatches\" aria-label=\"Brand colors\"><i style=\"background:#ff8d5e\"></i><i style=\"background:#fa3d72\"></i><i style=\"background:#a34de9\"></i><i style=\"background:#386ff2\"></i></div><p>Light, blur and Flightio’s spectrum create depth without obscuring the task.</p></div></div></section><div class=\"foot\"><span>COMPONENTS&nbsp; 01 / Mode selector &nbsp; 02 / Route fields &nbsp; 03 / Action &nbsp; 04 / Trip card</span><span class=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Try the controls above.</span></div></main><script>document.querySelectorAll('.mode').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.mode').forEach(x=>{x.classList.remove('active');x.setAttribute('aria-selected','false')});b.classList.add('active');b.setAttribute('aria-selected','true');document.querySelector('.status').textContent=b.textContent+' selected.'}));document.querySelector('.cta').addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelector('.status').textContent='Your journey is ready to explore.'});const send=()=>parent.postMessage({type:'desartly:preview-size',height:document.documentElement.scrollHeight},'*');addEventListener('load',send);new ResizeObserver(send).observe(document.body);</script></body></html>\n"
    }
  ]
}
